.TH AOC-GTK 1 "2026-11-08" "acer-open-control-gtk 0.3.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
aoc-gtk \- AcerOpenControl window
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B aoc-gtk
.SH DESCRIPTION
Graphical interface for the
.BR aocd (8)
daemon: temperatures, fan modes and curve editor, keyboard backlight,
performance profile, battery charge limit and webcam switch.
Set AOC_SOCKET to use a different daemon socket.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR aocctl (1)
